asr-000801
01:01:26.310 --> 01:01:43.370
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Your Honor, when we were doing a study on the cases pending before the Sandigan Bayan and the regional trial courts, there was a figure that struck us because we had cases which were filed in 1987, which are still in the Sandigan Bayan.

asr-000802
01:01:45.230 --> 01:01:56.270
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And there are so many cases that have a 15-year life already, which, of course, results in dismissal because of the interruption.

asr-000803
01:01:56.590 --> 01:02:06.690
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: So, Mr. Chairman, I think that we have laid down many parameters that are necessary for our prosecutors.

asr-000804
01:02:07.370 --> 01:02:13.450
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And among the most important of this is to be able to present our case continuously for one year.

asr-000805
01:02:13.870 --> 01:02:24.070
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And our target is to be able to present our cases within a one-year period from filing so that we will be able to arrest the prosecution's case within a one-year period from filing.

asr-000806
01:02:24.370 --> 01:02:25.730
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: That is an ideal.

asr-000807
01:02:26.310 --> 01:02:30.410
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: an ideal number, an ideal timeline, Mr. Chairman,

asr-000808
01:02:30.530 --> 01:02:33.690
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: because at least the memory of the judiciary will be fresh

asr-000809
01:02:33.690 --> 01:02:35.750
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: whenever we do this.

asr-000810
01:02:36.110 --> 01:02:38.850
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And there will be no more complaints about lost evidence,

asr-000811
01:02:39.410 --> 01:02:43.650
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: lost witnesses, and other things that happen,

asr-000812
01:02:43.950 --> 01:02:46.890
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: other miracles that happen when cases take a long time.

asr-000813
01:02:47.370 --> 01:02:50.490
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: So actually, that's a target, that's a very idealistic target.

asr-000814
01:02:50.890 --> 01:02:53.150
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: But I think it can be done with the cooperation, of course,

asr-000815
