Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: and there were no contributions made.

asr-000838
01:04:46.110 --> 01:04:50.790
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And the Secretary of Education at that time had a 7 billion cash advance,

asr-000839
01:04:51.510 --> 01:04:54.390
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: and there was nothing that could be done at that time.

asr-000840
01:04:54.630 --> 01:04:55.830
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: At least, I was a member of the House.

asr-000841
01:04:55.850 --> 01:04:57.930
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And I could not forget that.

asr-000842
01:04:58.430 --> 01:05:01.550
