asr-000938
01:09:39.650 --> 01:09:40.930
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: I think this is so critical.

asr-000939
01:09:41.370 --> 01:09:44.530
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And the old way of doing things was really much slower.

asr-000940
01:09:45.050 --> 01:09:49.310
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And we just have to streamline everything so that we can have more investigators

asr-000941
01:09:49.310 --> 01:09:50.790
