asr-000954
01:10:36.110 --> 01:10:38.050
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: so that we can streamline the hiring process.

asr-000955
01:10:38.050 --> 01:10:41.450
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Because it's actually something that has to be done.

asr-000956
01:10:41.930 --> 01:10:45.290
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Because a lot of people want to go for promotion when...

asr-000957
01:10:45.290 --> 01:10:48.290
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And this actually slows down everything.

asr-000958
